@@ -0,0 +1,23 @@
+(SYNTHETIC WIRE EDM FICTIONAL CODES)
+(SODICK MARK 21 WORDS - NOT VERIFIED ON A CONTROL - CHECK BEFORE CUTTING)
+(WIRE NOT THREADED AT START)
+(WORK OFFSET SET AT THE CONTROL - NO G92 IS WRITTEN)
+(TANK FILL AND FLUSHING ARE NOT PROGRAMMED - SET THEM AT THE CONTROL)
+(WIRE-CENTRE PATH - NO WIRE OFFSET G41 G42 IS USED)
+G21
+G90
+(Punch1 - Wire Contour)
+(SIDE PUNCH - KERF IN THE PATH)
+G54
+G00 X-30. Y0.
+T91
